# Antigravity (Google agentic IDE) — verified 2026-11-18
# Official site: https://antigravity.google
# googleapis.com / web.app / google.dev are also covered by Google.list;
# antigravity.google (.google TLD host) is the gap this list fixes.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antigravity.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antigravity.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antigravity.google.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antigravity-auth.web.app

# Unleash init API (.goog TLD) + Google Cloud auth host — both were
# uncovered and fell through to FINAL; eligibility may be decided here.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antigravity-unleash.goog
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloud.google

# Backend Cloud Code / PA endpoints observed for the Antigravity agent.
DOMAIN,antigravity-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,daily-cloudcode-pa.sandbox.googleapis.com

# Auto-updater (Cloud Run) — run.app is shared GCP infra, keep it exact.
DOMAIN,antigravity-ide-auto-updater-974169037036.us-central1.run.app
